Mozilla Public Suffix List (ICANN and private rules), offline snapshot.

Source: https://github.com/publicsuffix/list/blob/823beb1425def931c8b0b170a6bc33b424c3f9b0/public_suffix_list.dat
Imported from OpenJDK's public_suffix_list.dat, with its one-byte section
markers removed, sorted and gzip-compressed (mtime=0). No rules changed.
To update, replace the snapshot from publicsuffix/list and update this source.

